                     <code code="50566-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - STOP USE SECTION"/>
                     <title>Stop use and ask a doctor if</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Conditions worsens or does not improve after regular use of this product as directed</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20250520"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
               <component>
                  <section ID="id_link_e190f033-2ccf-49f9-e053-2a95a90aa3f2">
                     <id root="347f3665-e13f-e7a8-e063-6394a90a98dd"/>
                     <code code="50565-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - KEEP OUT OF REACH OF CHILDREN SECTION"/>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>Keep out of reach of children. If swallowed, get medical help or contact a Poison Control Center immediately.</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20250520"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
               <component>
                  <section ID="id_link_e190f7b9-c276-7b6f-e053-2995a90a9630">
                     <id root="347f31e8-ae91-ee82-e063-6394a90ae736"/>
                     <code code="34068-7" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="DOSAGE &amp; ADMINISTRATION SECTION"/>
                     <title>Directions</title>
                     <text>
                        <paragraph>■ Wash affected areas at least once daily with mild soap and warm water and dry thoroughly.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ Apply a small amount of NOPSOR pomade to affected areas after removing loose scales, one to four times daily or as directed by a doctor. Massage well.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ Intended for use by normally healthy adults only.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ Persons under 18 years of age, or those with highly sensitive or allergic skin should only use as directed by a doctor.</paragraph>
                     </text>
                     <effectiveTime value="20250520"/>
                  </section>
               </component>
               <component>
                  <section ID="id_link_347f4a0e-191f-f333-e063-6394a90a5eea">
