                        <paragraph>■ Use on affected areas in place of your regular soap or shampoo.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ Wet hair and/or skin thoroughly, then massage a liberal amount of NOPSOR Body Wash and Shampoo into the affected area and leave on for several minutes.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ Rinse thoroughly and repeat.</paragraph>
                        <paragraph>■ For best results, use at least twice a week or as directed by a doctor.</paragraph>
